      methodology lives in the bundled brain.aide template helper's
      `studyPlaybook` body section bytes only; the playbook-maintenance
      methodology lives in the bundled brain.aide template helper's
      `updatePlaybook` body section bytes only. provisionBrain does
      not read those bytes (the integration prose at first
      `/aide:brain config` does); duplicating them as a sibling
